.el .ds Aq '
.TH cadcraft-cli-commands 1  "commands " 
.SH NAME
cadcraft\-cli\-commands \- Print the command catalog as JSON
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcadcraft\-cli commands\fR [\fB\-\-compact\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIFILTER\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the command catalog as JSON
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-compact\fR
One line of JSON instead of pretty\-printed
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIFILTER\fR]
Only the commands whose id or label contains this text (case\-insensitive)
